---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Hugo Perez" description="Background, working style and engineering approach.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Profile / about.md</span><h1>Think clearly.<br/>Build deliberately.</h1><p>I’m a software engineer interested in the full product surface: how a problem is framed, how the system is structured, and how the final experience behaves.</p></header>
    <div class="profile-grid">
      <aside class="terminal-panel"><span>hugo.profile</span><img src="/assets/avatar.webp" alt="Portrait of Hugo Perez"/><dl><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Spain / Remote</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Product engineering</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd class="online">Open to opportunities</dd></div></dl></aside>
      <div class="principles"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Start with the constraints</h2><p>The technology matters after the product, users and operational limits are understood.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Connect the layers</h2><p>Interface quality, architecture and maintainability are parts of the same engineering decision.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Ship evidence</h2><p>I prefer working software, measurable outcomes and honest tradeoffs over decorative complexity.</p></div></article></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.profile-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:start}.profile-grid aside{position:sticky;top:7rem;padding:1rem}.profile-grid aside>span{display:block;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--accent-primary);font:.68rem var(--font-mono)}.profile-grid img{aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:.45rem;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.08)}dl{margin:1rem 0 0}dl div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--bg-border);font:.68rem var(--font-mono)}dt{color:var(--text-muted)}dd{margin:0;text-align:right}.online{color:var(--accent-primary)}.principles{border-top:1px solid var(--bg-border)}.principles article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bg-border)}.principles article>span{color:var(--accent-primary);font:.68rem var(--font-mono)}.principles h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.8rem)}.principles p{margin-top:1rem;max-width:580px}@media(max-width:760px){.profile-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.profile-grid aside{position:static}.profile-grid img{aspect-ratio:16/10}}
</style>
